    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fed up with unavoidable double ads before videos, the protagonist decides to enter a shooting game (shmup) where shooting down ads is the goal. Completing all stages promises an ad-free experience for a while, but is it really that simple?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bosses are Advertisers from Fictional Companies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bosses attack using their company products as bullet-hell advertisements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: Objects resembling hamburgers, cars, and realtors are advertisements and not actual food, vehicles, or people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Full Japanese Voice Acting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice Cast:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ky\u014dhei Natsume / Haruki Asada / Y\u016bki Amezawa / Daisuke Hirakawa / Masahiro Yamanaka</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: The English version will include Japanese audio with English subtitles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Beginner-Friendly Shmup</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recommended even for those who usually don't play shmup. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An Easy mode is available, and you can also increase the number of continues from the settings menu. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist's life is based on an HP gauge, so you can take more hits than it seems.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Original Soundtrack</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every stage and boss comes with its own custom-composed theme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With ever-changing vibes, there\u2019s never a dull moment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >All 7 Stages</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main Game: 6 stages \u00d7 3 difficulty levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extra Stage: 1 stage \u00d7 6 variations (with unique dialogues and ending illustrations)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ads Aren't the Enemy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeating bosses earns you skills that can be used in subsequent stages. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not shooting down ads \u2014 pausing your shots \u2014 can also prove beneficial.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Score Attack</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global score rankings are categorized by difficulty level. Advanced shooters, aim for the world's top score in Hard mode.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No In-Game Ads</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No real ads are included in this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll never be forced to watch one while playing\u2014promise!</p>",
