paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ads Aren't the Enemy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeating bosses earns you skills that can be used in subsequent stages. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not shooting down ads \u2014 pausing your shots \u2014 can also prove beneficial.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Score Attack</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global score rankings are categorized by difficulty level. Advanced shooters, aim for the world's top score in Hard mode.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No In-Game Ads</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No real ads are included in this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll never be forced to watch one while playing\u2014promise!</p>",
